  "body": "The \"reactivating a document\" steps will be run when a document regains full activity after restoring it from BFCache. This PR adds a note to those steps allows us to make the recommendation to listen to fully active state changes in [the BFCache guide](https://w3ctag.github.io/bfcache-guide/#listen-fully-active) better.\n\nNote that the former only covers the fully active -> fully active listener for BFCache cases, and not the fully active -> non fully active change. The latter case can already be implemented by adding \"[unloading document cleanup steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-lifecycle.html#unloading-document-cleanup-steps)\" (and to filter out documents that will be destroyed, the specs can check for the salvageable state). This PR also adds a comment to that function regarding the ordering, as mentioned in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8897#issuecomment-1434160458 and #8906. \n\ncc @annevk @domenic @fergald @smaug---- \n\n<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium\n   * WebKit\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/eaceee9...aff12b8/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/eaceee9...aff12b8/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">/references.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8897/eaceee9...aff12b8/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 24, 2023, 3:49 AM UTC (aff12b8)\">diff</a> )",
